WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.600
Show your Android screen in a browser.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.600
No app on the laptop. Nothing leaves your WiFi.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.000
HushCast. Cast quietly.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Straight to your laptop, through your own router.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.500
No internet needed.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Tap Start. Android asks first.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.800
Then you get a link.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.500
Scan the code, or type the name.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.600
Red when idle. Green while it casts.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:55.000
Then watch it in a browser.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.800
Live — screen and sound.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
One viewer. About a fifth of a second behind.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.400
Listen — sound only.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:18.000
Up to ten listeners. No screen captured.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.600
Cinema — for movies.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:30.500
Up to 4K. About ten seconds behind.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:38.000
No cloud. No account. No upload.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:44.600
Unplug the internet. It keeps going.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:49.600
Tap Stop, and it's gone.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:57.000
HushCast.
Live. Listen. Cinema.
Your WiFi.
